 "remarks": "Welcome to Harborview and this beautifully renovated, sought-after two-bedroom condominium with breathtaking year-round views of Norwalk Harbor. The private balcony is truly an extension of the home-an idyllic place to sip morning coffee, enjoy leisurely meals, unwind at the end of the day, watch boats glide across the harbor, and take in spectacular sunsets. Inside, a stunning renovation showcases engineered white oak hardwood floors, a fully redesigned luxurious primary suite with walk-in closet and beautifully appointed bath complete with steam shower and speaker in the shower to listen to your favorite music! In addition, there is a second generous sized bedroom. A stunning kitchen featuring white cabinetry, textured quartzite countertops, and high-end appliances flows into the SONOS Home Theater enhanced living/dining area then seamlessly to the balcony, creating an effortless setting for everyday living and entertaining. A redesigned laundry area offers a full-size washer and dryer, wine refrigerator, and storage. Enjoy your own boat slip and separate storage area for exceptional convenience. Harborview also offers a community room, pool room, and inviting spaces to gather, relax, and enjoy the waterfront setting. One car garage available plus one outside parking spot included.",
